  "b6_reason": "Null point is at x = R/4 from mass m (since m/x^2 = 9m/(R-x)^2 gives R-x = 3x); potential there is -Gm/x - 9Gm/(R-x) = -4Gm/R - 12Gm/R = -16Gm/R.",
